# The Ed25519 private key that proves this domain owns its MCP registry namespace
# (#358). The public half is a TXT record on tectonicplates.app and is meant to be
# read by anybody; this half signs the login and is the whole of the proof, so a
# commit of it hands the namespace to whoever reads the repo -- which is everybody,
# because this repo is public.
#
# Named rather than covered by a *.pem glob, so that a future certificate or a test
# fixture ending in .pem is a decision somebody makes rather than a file that silently
# vanishes from a diff.
key.pem
